{"steam_appid":4731620,"steam_name":"Fortune Mill","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4731620/479739695/9a14122e77e8320e0a3d872f8502b3e9b7dfdca2/1780798017/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781019128","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257346099/fb10f4e6a4cb242e071f7957cf8a22d5645cfa07/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781019128","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/810ed0d8e8465f953a49ab16c15b773293547c54/ss_810ed0d8e8465f953a49ab16c15b773293547c54.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783028565","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/c72cbc23450054adb1e72aac807dfa5d4d02c334/ss_c72cbc23450054adb1e72aac807dfa5d4d02c334.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783028565","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/e0aff5438e4cf8734c4089ed540dcf51883e1fc0/ss_e0aff5438e4cf8734c4089ed540dcf51883e1fc0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783028565","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/59c579bb453b36f9083f5e97901008de2af27c70/ss_59c579bb453b36f9083f5e97901008de2af27c70.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783028565","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/e856d9fcad533a45832f9381ae7806b1c5ce5431/ss_e856d9fcad533a45832f9381ae7806b1c5ce5431.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783028565"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/78972f9f782e6702dbf0feb71bf668d5.poster.avif?t=1783028565\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/78972f9f782e6702dbf0feb71bf668d5.webm?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/78972f9f782e6702dbf0feb71bf668d5.mp4?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start with $0 and work your way up to $1,000,000</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first throw earns $1 gold, one million seems impossible... <br>But then you buy +750% gold value upgrades, unlock the Rattling Gunner, throw double-darts, and before you know it you're earning $250,000 per throw! Gold is raining down, waiting to be collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/c39bbfe7384ded1a5906e3e3e79c40fd.poster.avif?t=1783028565\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/c39bbfe7384ded1a5906e3e3e79c40fd.webm?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/c39bbfe7384ded1a5906e3e3e79c40fd.mp4?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each room has new gameplay mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first scratcher earns you<strong> </strong>$6, one million seems impossible...  <br>But then you buy<strong> </strong>BIGGER tickets worth $100,000+, hire a<strong> </strong>tax-cheating Toad Accountant, and even win a jackpot for a<strong> </strong>golden dart-gun<strong> </strong>for your Rattling Gunner - that's right,<strong> each room </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/c527d08ebb95cef8586cb3555bf8dfed.poster.avif?t=1783028565\" width=632 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/c527d08ebb95cef8586cb3555bf8dfed.webm?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/c527d08ebb95cef8586cb3555bf8dfed.mp4?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each room has Automation &amp; Bonuses which helps other rooms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit JACKPOTS</strong> in Room 2 for big permanent bonuses to all rooms!<br><strong>Roll DICE </strong>in Room 3 for massive multipliers to earnings in all rooms!<br><strong>Cook SUSHI </strong>in Room 4 for unique game-altering effects for all rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/ff93e945e51be63bc725490824366fef.poster.avif?t=1783028565\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/ff93e945e51be63bc725490824366fef.webm?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/ff93e945e51be63bc725490824366fef.mp4?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You were meant to be packaged into Box #724</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now you're crawling through a crack in the wall, no idea where it goes, hoping it's a way out...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL GAMEPLAY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different rooms full of unique games - Darts, Scratch-offs, Pachinko, and several more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Automation across the game, no matter which room you're in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ unique upgrades which affect gameplay in increasingly meaningful ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special upgrades that affect ALL rooms - each room affects the others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;New Game+&quot; bonus modes, each with unique exclusive upgrades that give huge replay value beyond your 1st run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal Mode, an (optional) official speedrun mode that rewards strategic gameplay after your 1st run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 different creatures to befriend<strong> </strong>or bribe - from Bubba the Seal, to the iconic Abacus Frog!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you make $1,000,000 and escape the FORTUNE MILL?</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/d5c83cb4d6bce0042ca87c9cebccec49.poster.avif?t=1783028565\" width=740 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/d5c83cb4d6bce0042ca87c9cebccec49.webm?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731620/extras/d5c83cb4d6bce0042ca87c9cebccec49.mp4?t=1783028565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2 support, with 4 physical cores or more<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full OpenGL 3.3 support or Direct3D 11 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Anything capable of producing sound</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Lavaflame2"],"publishers":["Lavaflame2"],"release_date":"2 Jun, 2026"}